{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChM4bkw8KThADTx7E3sHW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[x] `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, and `npm run test:ts` pass, and the Go build and Go tests still pass.\n\nAll three items are done. No production code had to change: tickets 27 and 28 had already made `doctorRoundtripCheck` and the `doctorProbe` fake work on the `responses` and `anthropic` protocols. This ticket adds the tests that pin that behaviour down.\n\n**What changed:** one new test in `test/cli/doctor.ts`, run once for `responses` and once for `anthropic`. It runs `doctor --json` in-process against the provider fake and checks two things:\n- Both roles' `-roundtrip` rows pass.\n- The request log is exactly one GET of the models list followed by two POSTs for each role, on `/v1/responses` or `/v1/messages`.\n\nThe fake answers 400 to a forced tool choice or a changed tools or message prefix. A passing row plus an exact request count therefore means no request was rejected.\n\n**No red step:** both tests passed on the first run, because the behaviour was already there. To check that they can fail, I temporarily changed the adapters to force tool choice (`required` for `responses`, `{type:'any'}` for `anthropic`). Both tests then failed, and I reverted the change.\n\n**Verification:** lint passed, `go build ./...` and `npm run test:go` passed (Go packages plus 22 launcher tests), and the full `npm run test:ts` passed all 7,513 assertions. No `.roast/` directory leaked into the checkout.\n\nEverything is in commit `1ac7146`; `.redeye/notes.md` is left uncommitted as instructed. I didn't add anything to AGENTS.md, because `docs/agents/llm.md` already explains how `doctorProbe` handles each protocol."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":248,"cache_read_input_tokens":77246,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":248},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8db26e43-7bde-47a9-88ba-95dcb38ede5e","uuid":"843dd485-c4e8-4487-9e3a-6930e8d441f3","timestamp":"2026-11-24T03:43:32.473Z","request_id":"req_011ChM4bkXa6znhuCY34WzXT"}
